    "detailed_description": "This is a Side Scrolling Shooting game where you dodge flying enemy ships and their bullets.<br>At the end of each level there is a Boss to defeat before moving onto the next level.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1410540/extras/0e4478bef8e71e747d59a37a32b465e3.poster.avif?t=1754118254\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1410540/extras/0e4478bef8e71e747d59a37a32b465e3.webm?t=1754118254\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1410540/extras/0e4478bef8e71e747d59a37a32b465e3.mp4?t=1754118254\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>When playing Multiplayer, if any player completes the level everyone starts the next level.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1410540/extras/885012a92de07625eac6169dfd4bdc56.poster.avif?t=1754118254\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1410540/extras/885012a92de07625eac6169dfd4bdc56.webm?t=1754118254\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1410540/extras/885012a92de07625eac6169dfd4bdc56.mp4?t=1754118254\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>This is a Pure Gameplay game<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1410540/extras/0d561fddc615875f6f6d588b92433fc1.avif?t=1754118254\" /></div><br>Do you even know how to Dodge a bullet?<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1410540/extras/65aa242bb659e7eee0d79621ab3b19fd.poster.avif?t=1754118254\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1410540/extras/65aa242bb659e7eee0d79621ab3b19fd.webm?t=1754118254\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1410540/extras/65aa242bb659e7eee0d79621ab3b19fd.mp4?t=1754118254\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>This side scrolling shooter has been created to highlight the playable aspects of the game. Which means we have no story, we have no extravagant graphics, we have no epic cut-scenes. <br>Have fun.",
    "about_the_game": "This is a Side Scrolling Shooting game where you dodge flying enemy ships and their bullets.<br>At the end of each level there is a Boss to defeat before moving onto the next level.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1410540/extras/0e4478bef8e71e747d59a37a32b465e3.poster.avif?t=1754118254\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1410540/extras/0e4478bef8e71e747d59a37a32b465e3.webm?t=1754118254\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1410540/extras/0e4478bef8e71e747d59a37a32b465e3.mp4?t=1754118254\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>When playing Multiplayer, if any player completes the level everyone starts the next level.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1410540/extras/885012a92de07625eac6169dfd4bdc56.poster.avif?t=1754118254\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1410540/extras/885012a92de07625eac6169dfd4bdc56.webm?t=1754118254\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1410540/extras/885012a92de07625eac6169dfd4bdc56.mp4?t=1754118254\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>This is a Pure Gameplay game<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1410540/extras/0d561fddc615875f6f6d588b92433fc1.avif?t=1754118254\" /></div><br>Do you even know how to Dodge a bullet?<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1410540/extras/65aa242bb659e7eee0d79621ab3b19fd.poster.avif?t=1754118254\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1410540/extras/65aa242bb659e7eee0d79621ab3b19fd.webm?t=1754118254\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1410540/extras/65aa242bb659e7eee0d79621ab3b19fd.mp4?t=1754118254\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>This side scrolling shooter has been created to highlight the playable aspects of the game. Which means we have no story, we have no extravagant graphics, we have no epic cut-scenes. <br>Have fun.",
